                  <nc xml:id="m-e2871739-5d83-4392-bb17-27310a58486e" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-4774f414-912d-4096-8a5b-bede552b97f7">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-7309a94e-bb8b-485e-89bc-a078af5cdec8" type="clivis" xml:id="m-92b67fac-79db-435e-a829-825db7aa1194">
                  <nc xml:id="m-daec4f96-55d1-47f4-b897-7e0aedda0aa1" pname="a" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-8ef8228e-cef3-4446-9763-f7203dc70611" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-96a4d619-c626-49ad-9ed7-30c3c94649e2" facs="#m-bbf296e0-50b4-43c0-9f7d-7df97aa14001" pname="f" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-c9f4dd5c-2b46-4cb1-b511-62308cab33eb"><lg xml:id="m-61750af8-29e5-4b80-b9d9-04c606c525fd"><l xml:id="m-ed455c8b-d50e-44a5-b0c4-473843288fc1" facs="#m-5ccdadc7-7581-4dfc-ac01-81a3081aefda" label="ambiguous">In Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-7b8ce36a-696d-4d65-961d-6db098088d93" facs="#m-01250230-e1b1-48bb-b8cf-a78440db645a" label="ambiguous">1868</l><l xml:id="m-19b5ae48-bfb4-4d45-a4a5-095bd9354e75" facs="#m-3a8a3cd2-58e6-4353-81eb-c7a5d246ecbc" label="lyrics-like">non est á-li¬ us</l><l xml:id="m-e299b462-67d5-485e-930f-274d3a0de58d" facs="#m-c2eec907-7c63-4793-9d9c-190372d69dcf" label="lyrics-like">qui púgnet pro nóbis, ni-si tu</l><l xml:id="m-07b11ecf-4a84-4177-be14-69d569bcc4b3" facs="#m-e1417011-7dd6-4d10-88fb-60fc1be51ed9" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us nóster.</l><l xml:id="m-ddc69abc-8fc0-4141-9fd5-1a001c3d7e96" facs="#m-eb3ef942-57fb-416f-ab0e-36c0512ebe59" label="lyrics-like">V. Fíat pax in virtúte túa.</l><l xml:id="m-2846323b-5d2d-433c-93ac-ac236f63b8c7" facs="#m-028d89bd-b814-4a51-ba1a-eb1d6bc987c3" label="lyrics-like">K. Et abundántia in túrribus túis.</l><l xml:id="m-adacd1b5-6ef9-4b5a-92e2-97d2ec7aee94" facs="#m-e7bc5086-2bd7-4363-8239-c5c36bf9de46" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-f1702e5f-4614-4f13-8b50-31c6d655c64e" facs="#m-8199dce0-e127-4b3f-a4c9-348a18545171" label="lyrics-like">Eus, a quo sancta desidéria, dédita, et, hóstium subláta formí¬</l><l xml:id="m-af3c75d2-2b1e-41f8-81f4-d3eb7ae2d88f" facs="#m-7c14943d-1fb2-4258-bc75-259a14243add" label="ambiguous">Orecta consilia, et justa sunt</l><l xml:id="m-429ddf24-7a34-4377-b579-0a52fa08a661" facs="#m-061e0dc9-14a1-4070-852e-2b83c4d5d245" label="lyrics-like">dine, témpora sint tua protectióne</l><l xml:id="m-dcc5b1d3-b0d8-40bb-b611-fb73c16e6b25" facs="#m-3e3b1259-f03c-4eba-9325-589fd475521b" label="lyrics-like">tranquilla. Per Christum Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-ac49cbd1-6f97-43fa-9fa1-813ba973989c" facs="#m-ff2c5b30-e403-41d6-a56d-2f8f9626358c" label="lyrics-like">ópera:t da servis tuis illam, quam</l><l xml:id="m-3b96a16b-e15f-4c4c-ad13-7b350b666987" facs="#m-55a39c17-d23a-48ab-bc1e-2e15477e226a" label="ambiguous">nostrum. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-a93576c8-7e12-4069-88b0-f05d7d5d0276" facs="#m-f57a2c49-5447-42f3-a574-f79ea8714dab" label="ambiguous">mundus dare non potest, pacem;"</l><l xml:id="m-18440543-fdce-4b8c-9c4e-64c0697a4c86" facs="#m-c23b3478-6af9-475e-adf3-43104303f7a2" label="lyrics-like">ut et corda nostra mandátis tuis</l><l xml:id="m-48ac1ee3-230f-4c6d-818e-0ffb6379fff9" facs="#m-08085b15-a712-467a-a24c-1943b9027ab6" label="text-like">AT A TIME OF PENANCE.</l><l xml:id="m-ae1a90ee-4731-4798-a269-836101fef647" facs="#m-11342f8e-052c-4e8f-bd0c-68240aeae802" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-259068f0-74f7-4a3b-a591-45a3a6236e54" facs="#m-d58828c8-03cd-49c0-8fba-437ddf38b43f" label="lyrics-like">Arce Dómine, párce pópu-lo tú¬ ne in aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-a5b394fb-1286-40af-9a99-13d63368caa8" facs="#m-0aea46cc-d443-43ab-9204-f82d013be7cd" label="lyrics-like">num i-rascá-ris nó-bis.</l><l xml:id="m-aebd4934-1ecf-40c1-b865-4686c05fcf19" facs="#m-c098801b-bab3-4a60-909c-9d498c5b22c4" label="ambiguous">IN ADVENT. *</l><l xml:id="m-30bee8a1-fe5b-4cbb-9508-6e4749f2c7bf" facs="#m-33f532ed-2945-43a9-b91b-841a524e8c40" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-640c4da3-14aa-43f8-b92e-f264ac31b0e3" facs="#m-4a13220c-dec9-41c1-8d76-3854dec3af4a" label="lyrics-like">Oráte caéli dé-super, et núbes plú-ant jústum.</l><l xml:id="m-9f717c9e-d8ca-4128-a072-4c82f1a83ab2" facs="#m-df810aa2-60c8-4dd9-9f95-e594c937caa0" label="lyrics-like">The Choir repeats: Roráte.</l><l xml:id="m-851e4881-04d3-4edb-b1da-878ddae15131" facs="#m-a1b9076e-25f8-444c-8db9-45a903e2c95c" label="lyrics-like">1.Ne i-rascá-ris Dómine, ne ultra memíne-ris in-iqui-tá¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
